<title>LEBANON: Lebanese monthly t-bill maturities.</title>
<headline>Lebanese monthly t-bill maturities.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lebanese Banks Association issued the following details of monthly maturities of Lebanese treasury bills in circulation on November 14.</p>
<p>(in billions of Lebanese pounds)</p>
<p>Year/Month 3-month 6-month 12-month 24-month Total</p>
<p>1996 Nov     139     97	108	86	430</p>
<p>     Dec     341    208	259	48	856</p>
<p>1997 Jan     429    427	423	71    1,350</p>
<p>     Feb     170    391	309	52	922</p>
<p>     Mar	-     383	268	47	698</p>
<p>     Apr	-     605	277	37	919</p>
<p>     May	-     403	500	 5	909</p>
<p>     Jun	-	-	 329	19	348</p>
<p>     Jul	-	-	 537     137	674</p>
<p>     Aug	-	-	 393	20	413</p>
<p>     Sep	-	-	 377	60	437</p>
<p>     Oct	-	-	 682     302	984</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 645456</p>
